{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:06.789243+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"related: https://github.com/iree-org/iree/pull/24642","created_at":"2026-07-23T10:46:28Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/24653#issuecomment-5057507293","id":5057507293,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M8AAAABLXNv3Q","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/5057507293/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-23T10:46:28Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/5057507293","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9053039?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devtbi","id":9053039,"login":"devtbi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTMwMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtbi","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### What happened?\n\nIn `native_executable.c` the export function lookup uses a direct string equality check: https://github.com/iree-org/iree/blob/a4d0287253fbe7211f545cda304b487218c2a711/runtime/src/iree/hal/drivers/cuda/native_executable.c#L559\n\nHowever, during compilation, the export names are sanitized due to strict naming requirements in PTX:\nhttps://github.com/iree-org/iree/blob/a4d0287253fbe7211f545cda304b487218c2a711/compiler/plugins/target/CUDA/CUDATarget.cpp#L545\nhttps://github.com/iree-org/iree/blob/a4d0287253fbe7211f545cda304b487218c2a711/compiler/plugins/target/CUDA/CUDATarget.cpp#L659\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce your issue\n\nMRE:\n```mlir\nmodule @repro {\n  util.func public @main(%arg0: tensor<4xf32>, %arg1: tensor<4xf32>) -> tensor<4xf32> {\n    %0 = util.call @callee$async(%arg0, %arg1) : (tensor<4xf32>, tensor<4xf32>) -> tensor<4xf32>\n    util.return %0 : tensor<4xf32>\n  }\n  util.func private @callee$async(%arg0: tensor<4xf32>, %arg1: tensor<4xf32>) -> tensor<4xf32>\n      attributes {inlining_policy = #util.inline.never} {\n    %0 = arith.addf %arg0, %arg1 : tensor<4xf32>\n    util.return %0 : tensor<4xf32>\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```bash\n$ iree-compile --iree-hal-target-device=cuda --iree-cuda-target=ampere \\\n             --iree-execution-model=async-external \\\n             iree_cuda_dollar_repro.mlir -o repro_cuda.vmfb\n\n# NOT_FOUND; function 'callee$async_dispatch_0_elementwise_4_f32' not found in executable\n$ iree-run-module --module=repro_cuda.vmfb --device=cuda \\\n                --function=main --input=4xf32=1 --input=4xf32=2\n```\n\nCompiles and runs fine on CPU:\n```bash\n$ iree-compile --iree-hal-target-device=local \\\n             --iree-hal-local-target-device-backends=llvm-cpu \\\n             --iree-execution-model=async-external \\\n             iree_cuda_dollar_repro.mlir -o repro_cpu.vmfb\n$ iree-run-module --module=repro_cpu.vmfb --device=local-task \\\n                --function=main --input=4xf32=1 --input=4xf32=2\n```\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\nRuntime\n\n### Version information\n\nCommit hash 59f952c5a83777e78f251e238338d7345a1bfb36\n\n### Additional context\n\nDiscovered when compiling a CNN model exported from pytorch using `iree-turbine`. I believe this same workflow ran fine around a year ago but cannot pinpoint exactly when the regression occurred, since bisecting that many commits would take forever.","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653/comments","created_at":"2026-06-30T16:31:07Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/24653","id":4778624969,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDODGgK6M8AAAABHNQHyQ","number":24653,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653/timeline","title":"[CUDA] Runtime export lookup uses unsanitized name while compilation sanitizes export names","type":null,"updated_at":"2026-07-23T10:46:28Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/24653","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297978903?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branden-pan